t":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Hidden Moon] and [Shrouded Sun] are cast together; lifts Left Claw of Sui and attacks the eastmost ally after a delay, dealing heavy Physical damage to all allies in the area","Sui's RES is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and Its Left Claw will no longer use [Hidden Moon]"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":300000,"atk":800,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.1}},"right_claw_of_sui":{"slug":"right_claw_of_sui","name":"Right Claw of Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Right Claw of Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Shrouded Sun] and [Hidden Moon] are cast together; lifts Right Claw of Sui and attacks the westmost ally after a delay, dealing heavy Physical damage to all allies in the area","Sui's DEF is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and Its Right Claw will no longer use [Shrouded Sun]"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":300000,"atk":800,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.2}},"sui_enemy_1582_suisho":{"slug":"sui_enemy_1582_suisho","name":"Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The final god felled by Yan has risen again. It raises Its head and sees time immemorial from beginning to end, but It has never truly dwelled in the mortal realm.","abilities":["The four body parts share an HP pool and cast skills in order; individual body parts leave the battlefield after taking a certain amount of damage","Parts are lifted when skills are used, preventing them from being attacked, and the tiles they are on become deployable and passable","Bringing a body part under the influence of a suppression pillar weakens the corresponding stats and skills; Sui gains a large stat bonus and takes less Physical and Arts damage when it is at full strength","[Wrath of Eons] Raises Sui's Head and breathes fire at the northmost ally after a delay, dealing Arts damage and inflicting Burn; flames spread southwards and continues to burn in an area, dealing Arts damage, inflicting Burn, and igniting <'Unquenched'>; remains on the field for a while","[Sundered Pillars] When HP falls below a certain point, summons extra enemies, and the 4 body parts simultaneously cast [Wrath of Eons], [Hidden Moon], [Shrouded Sun], and [Order Overturned]","Sui's ATK is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and [Wrath of Eons] range is reduced"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":300000,"atk":800,"def":1600,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"tail_of_sui":{"slug":"tail_of_sui","name":"Tail of Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tail of Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Order Overturned] Lifts Tail of Sui and attacks the southmost ally after a delay, dealing Physical damage to all allies in the area three times; spawns <'Unquenched'> based on the number of allies defeated this way","Sui's HP is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and range and damage of [Order Overturned] are reduced"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":300000,"atk":800,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.3}},"wield_arms":{"slug":"wield_arms","name":"Wield Arms","icon":"/enemies-icons/Wield Arms.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist born of the influence of a Sui proxy, whose original name was 'Soldier'. The histories write: 'Upon the peaks was the beast cornered and killed.' It was the battlefield where the Feranmut was hunted, and where countless soldiers were buried. The smoke dissipates and the broken armor sinks into the sand, as the bleached bones hope to return in spring.","abilities":["Vanishes when encountering another type of enemy, granting the target a portion of this unit's ATK, DEF, and RES, stacking up to 3 times per unit"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"fieldmus":{"slug":"fieldmus","name":"Fieldmus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fieldmus.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The fieldmus is the farmer's sworn enemy, as well as a living page from the annals of Terra's agricultural history. They have adapted to modern farming techniques, and even Throttle Valves cannot escape their destructive tendencies.","abilities":["Attacks surrounding Throttle Valves","Becomes Invisible on Blighted tiles"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":1700,"atk":180,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"sky_pole_yi":{"slug":"sky_pole_yi","name":"Sky Pole - Yi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sky Pole - Yi.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"UAV-type comprehensive monitoring-maintenance system on experimental plates, Sky Pole Model Yi. Capable of completing tasks within the signal range of Model Jia, such as collecting crop samples, eliminating pests, spraying pesticides, and driving away trespassing beasts.","abilities":["Latches onto the first unit within range and relentlessly attacks until the target is defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":1,"atk":200,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"ribbon_in_the_waves":{"slug":"ribbon_in_the_waves","name":"Ribbon in the Waves","icon":"/enemies-icons/Ribbon in the Waves.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist born of the influence of a Sui proxy, whose original name was 'Falsehood'. 'He who claims himself pure should be cast into murky waters.' Purity and corruption, truth and falsehood, are never decided by the fins swimming in the river.","abilities":["Can move through empty Glyph Tiles","Exits glyph form when stamped by a Stamp, becoming stunned, and cannot turn back to glyph form for a while","Cannot be teleported"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":550,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"blindey":{"slug":"blindey","name":"'Blindey'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Blindey'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A reckless Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Rushes forward single-mindedly, its surroundings be damned, and tends to find itself in all kinds of predicaments because of that. Doesn't get along with Stabby. Can only be blocked by units of the same attribute.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by player's units of the same attribute."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":14000,"atk":800,"def":600,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"fury":{"slug":"fury","name":"'Fury'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Fury'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","da